WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:01.543
So what we're looking at

00:00:01.543 --> 00:00:03.128
here is something insane.

00:00:03.128 --> 00:00:05.505
This is a model of every tree,

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:06.715
every house,

00:00:06.715 --> 00:00:10.135
every valley, every gondola

00:00:10.135 --> 00:00:11.302
in the country of Switzerland.

00:00:11.302 --> 00:00:13.221
The Swiss government is obsessed

00:00:13.221 --> 00:00:14.139
with detailed,

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:15.682
precise mapping,

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:18.101
and they've created a full model

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:19.811
that all of us can play around

00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:21.229
with on the Internet

00:00:21.229 --> 00:00:22.772
of their entire country.

00:00:22.772 --> 00:00:24.816
Like it's incredibly detailed.

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:27.068
It is every little mountain,

00:00:27.068 --> 00:00:30.071
every structure in the entire country

00:00:30.405 --> 00:00:31.239
is mapped

00:00:31.239 --> 00:00:33.158
here, including, look,

00:00:33.158 --> 00:00:35.076
we've got chairlifts.

00:00:35.076 --> 00:00:36.369
Yeah, this exists.

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:37.537
This is a real thing.

